WEBVTT

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:07.060
Shaking my hands 'cuz I'm here for you.

00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:10.380
Please hug me as tight as you can right now!

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:13.570
Hold on tight to the warmth

00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:20.120
that's sprouted inside my little heart.

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:30.360
Never say "It's hopeless" and get down in the dumps!

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:31.800
Go! Go!

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:37.180
Hold on till blue skies spread inside your heart.

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:40.060
Always in the rainy days in my life!

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:43.430
Always in the good days in my life!

00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:50.440
Never hesitate! Give all you've got! Never give up!

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:54.820
Shaking my hands 'cuz I'm here for you!

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:58.280
Jumping as high as I can 'cuz I long for you!

00:00:58.280 --> 00:01:01.410
The scenery reflected in your eyes

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:04.870
is a memory I carry with me.

00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:08.250
Feeling my kick though I've sworn to help you,

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:11.610
I make mistakes when maybe I shouldn't.

00:01:11.610 --> 00:01:15.010
It may hurt me deep inside my heart,

00:01:15.010 --> 00:01:20.930
but with experience the clouds in there will clear away.

00:01:46.570 --> 00:01:48.210
Good morning, May.

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:50.540
Oh, good morning, Kazuya!

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:52.040
It's going to be another nice day!

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:52.870
Sure is.

00:01:52.870 --> 00:01:53.590
Yeah!

00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:56.670
<i>I've been living with Kazuya for a week now.</i>

00:01:56.670 --> 00:01:58.590
<i>I've finally got the hang of working here.</i>

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:15.480
<i>I'm trying my best to help Kazuya, like I always do!</i>

00:02:20.710 --> 00:02:23.950
Clean, clean, clean.

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:25.080
Clean, clean...

00:02:26.350 --> 00:02:27.270
May?!

00:02:28.380 --> 00:02:29.920
You okay?

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:34.210
Yeah... I'm fine... Huh?

00:02:34.490 --> 00:02:37.800
Kazuya, your face is all red!

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:39.510
You don't have a fever, do you?

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:41.680
Oh, no! Medicine! Medicine! A thermometer! Water!

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:43.470
It's nothing.

00:02:43.470 --> 00:02:45.220
Time! Time!

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:47.220
Supplement! Supplement!

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:49.770
I've got Prof. Yumi's supplemental course today!

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:52.020
If I'm late, I won't get credit!

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:54.820
May, watch the apartment while I'm at class, okay?

00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:57.900
Sure! I'll do the cleaning, the laundry, the shopping, and make dinner!

00:02:57.910 --> 00:02:59.450
I'll have <i>everything</i> done for you!

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:01.240
Um, just cleaning up would be fine.

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:06.290
Huh? But why? I Can do the laundry and the shopping, too.

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:08.040
Now look, May.

00:03:08.050 --> 00:03:11.820
Outside can be very dangerous for someone your size.

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:16.300
Besides, if people saw you, it'd probably cause a panic, right?

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:17.380
But...

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:19.970
We'll go shopping together, when I get back.

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:21.830
Just take care of my room, okay?

00:03:21.830 --> 00:03:21.840
Right...
Just take care of my room, okay?

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:22.840
Right...

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:26.890
And don't go outside by yourself. Not one step, okay?

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:28.500
I understand.

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:30.980
Well, gotta go.

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:32.670
See you later.

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:47.590
For this situation...

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:50.820
That's it!

00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:06.340
Hello? Saotome Residence.

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:11.140
Why's a girl answering?! Kazuya Saotome, you pervert!

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:14.060
That sister-con, loli-con, mother-con, triple complex con-man,

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:15.740
Kazuya Saotome has a girl there?!

00:04:15.740 --> 00:04:17.280
THAT JUST CAN NOT BE!

00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:22.610
I was planning to send him Nanbara virus version 2.0,

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:25.570
but I'll get in his way! Destroy his relationship! Break them up!

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:26.820
Just you wait, my rival!

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:31.740
Gimme a refill, pops!

00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:33.920
Sure, there ya go!

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:39.960
It's soy sauce ramen, like at the last place, but it tastes different!

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:41.800
Oh, this is truly a legendary dish!

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:43.560
Such mysteries it holds...

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:49.670
Gimme a refill, pops!

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:54.270
Jeez, you've got a hell of an appetite, miss!

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:57.260
What do you do for a living? Professional eater, maybe?

00:04:57.600 --> 00:04:58.600
My job?

00:05:02.120 --> 00:05:04.150
It's collection day already?! Oh, crap!

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:06.680
Uh, miss! Wait!

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:10.370
Doesn't she want her prize money?

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:14.160
<i>Okay, next you add a full teaspoon of salt.</i>

00:05:15.550 --> 00:05:16.650
Salt!

00:05:17.280 --> 00:05:21.410
One... full... teaspoon!

00:05:25.930 --> 00:05:27.680
Cooking is hard!

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:31.680
Yes? Who's there, please?

00:05:31.680 --> 00:05:33.640
Saotome, my dearest friend! How cold of you!

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:35.730
You simply <i>must</i> introduce me to your girlfriend!

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:39.690
No fair, hiding her from me!
Your happiness is my happiness, too!

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:42.630
Why don't you share it with <i>me</i>,

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:46.610
Kazuya?

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:48.910
Kazuya is at the university right now.

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:49.870
EGAD!

00:05:52.030 --> 00:05:53.820
Are you a friend of Kazuya's?

00:05:54.490 --> 00:05:55.900
It... It talked!

00:05:56.660 --> 00:05:58.330
A-A-A-And moved!

00:06:00.660 --> 00:06:03.250
Were you the one who answered the phone?

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:04.960
Yes. My name's May.

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:08.760
Um... well... I'm Kazuya's friend from school.

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:13.030
His best friend and greatest enemy: Kotaro Nanbara.

00:06:13.540 --> 00:06:16.730
Oh, you're a friend of Kazuya's? Excuse me.

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:18.800
I'll go get you some milk!

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:24.930
Yo!

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:27.350
<i>Of course! I see!</i>

00:06:28.390 --> 00:06:33.950
<i>So, Saotome! You built a new mini-bot without telling me!</i>

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:35.910
<i>All your discoveries belong to me!</i>

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:37.830
<i>And what's mine is mine!</i>

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:40.080
<i>So, if the great Nanbara wants your mini-bot,</i>

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:42.360
HE'LL TAKE IT!

00:06:43.600 --> 00:06:45.960
Stop it, please!

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:47.970
An unusually feminine mini-bot...

00:06:47.970 --> 00:06:50.510
I see where your tastes lie, Saotome!

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:52.800
I'm not a "mini-bot"!

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:55.430
I'm May! Please, let me down!

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:57.060
Silence, mini-bot!

00:06:57.060 --> 00:06:59.350
I'm not...!

00:06:59.350 --> 00:07:02.980
I'm going to present you as my own invention!

00:07:02.980 --> 00:07:05.230
Look at me and despair, Kazuya Saotome!

00:07:07.660 --> 00:07:11.280
Mr. Kazuya Saotome?

00:07:12.460 --> 00:07:16.700
Mr. Saotome, we've yet to receive the $1,450,000 payment,

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:20.540
for the Cyber Doll May unit that was delivered to you before.

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:23.540
Would you like to pay the full amount today?

00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:29.550
I'm saying you have to pay for the merchandise which <i>you</i> accepted.

00:07:29.550 --> 00:07:31.950
<i>I</i> have to?

00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:34.890
Yeah, ya do! Of course you do!

00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:35.720
Why should I?

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:38.050
Why should ya?!

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:42.370
Because you, Kazuya Saotome, ordered her!

00:07:42.960 --> 00:07:43.810
Oh, I see!

00:07:44.120 --> 00:07:46.400
Too bad, but I can't pay it.

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:48.190
WHAT?! What was that?!

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:52.320
The reason being that I am not Kazuya Saotome!

00:07:52.940 --> 00:07:58.330
How rude! Mistaking me for that penniless Saotome.

00:07:58.330 --> 00:07:59.870
Now get the hell out of here!

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:01.790
Then what are ya doin' in this apartment?!

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:04.650
If ya won't pay, I'm takin' Cyber Doll May back!

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:06.390
I won't let you. The mini-bot belongs to me!

00:08:06.390 --> 00:08:07.340
Hold it!

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:10.550
Stop it, please!

00:08:10.550 --> 00:08:11.570
Give 'er back!

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:14.350
Come back here!

00:08:14.350 --> 00:08:15.470
Do your best...

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:19.930
Oh, yeah! Gotcha! I win!

00:08:19.930 --> 00:08:21.350
Huh? She's gone!

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:23.390
What the hell are you people doing?!

00:08:24.470 --> 00:08:27.400
I came to see what all the excitement was about.

00:08:28.980 --> 00:08:31.710
Hello, police? I have two weirdos here who've broken in.

00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:33.990
Why should I?

00:08:34.350 --> 00:08:38.660
This is the landlady's lovely daughter at Kasumi House.

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:39.980
Yes, that's right.

00:08:39.980 --> 00:08:41.410
We have to retreat for now!

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:43.490
Hey! Where are we going?!

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:54.870
Are you all right, May?

00:08:54.870 --> 00:08:58.600
Oh, I'm just fine...

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:00.100
Jeez!

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:02.470
We're just getting weirder and weirder people around here!

00:09:02.470 --> 00:09:04.350
Yeah, and besides that...

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:07.610
I worked so hard to clean everything up, too.

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:12.280
It's all right. That's how it looked before, anyway.

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:14.050
Don't worry about it!

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:21.040
Cheer up! I brought you something nice.

00:09:21.040 --> 00:09:22.490
Ta-da!

00:09:22.490 --> 00:09:24.660
What happened to your hands?

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:26.870
Oh, uh, never mind about that!

00:09:28.030 --> 00:09:29.230
It's Shikishima!

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:34.010
Shikishima! I'm getting that rent today!

00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:35.590
Uh, Kasumi? What is this?

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:37.050
Give it to Kazuya.

00:09:37.050 --> 00:09:38.570
He'll understand when you give it to him!

00:09:39.750 --> 00:09:40.890
Right...

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:43.770
Even though it's summer vacation, you're still working hard.

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:45.730
Why don't you knock off for today?

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:47.480
Sorry. I've got a little more work to do.

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:48.940
Oh, I see.

00:09:48.950 --> 00:09:50.690
You should take it easy.

00:09:50.690 --> 00:09:51.610
Sure.

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:53.290
Something happen to him?

00:09:53.290 --> 00:09:54.650
He's suddenly a lot more into working.

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:55.490
Dunno.

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:56.900
We'll see you later, then.

00:09:56.900 --> 00:09:57.290
Right.

00:09:57.290 --> 00:09:57.860
See you!

00:09:57.860 --> 00:09:58.490
Right.

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:09.940
<i>And now, the second in the drama series of youth and true love:</i>

00:10:10.810 --> 00:10:12.500
<i>"The Whirlwind of Love."</i>

00:10:13.280 --> 00:10:16.630
<i>Just as the blowing winds tore them apart,</i>

00:10:22.250 --> 00:10:23.520
<i>Yamazaki, wait!</i>

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:25.890
<i>Dad told me to bring you this.</i>

00:10:25.890 --> 00:10:29.190
<i>For me? Thank you, Mika.</i>

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:30.480
<i>Yamazaki!</i>

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:31.310
<i>Mika!</i>

00:10:31.310 --> 00:10:33.980
<i>Starring Gin Munakata as Kintaro Yamazaki,</i>

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:36.690
<i>and Naomi Ryuzaki as Mika Rokujoin.</i>

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:38.360
<i>Give it to Kazuya.</i>

00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:39.990
<i>He'll understand when you give it to him!</i>

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:44.620
Kazuya! I brought this for you from Kasumi!

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:46.240
Ma-a-a-ay!

00:10:48.810 --> 00:10:51.300
Thank you so much for bringing this for me, May!

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:56.560
Oh, Kazuya! I'm just happy to be useful to you!

00:10:58.660 --> 00:10:59.640
All right, then!

00:11:16.380 --> 00:11:20.540
Kasumi, I swear I'll get this to Kazuya!

00:11:24.250 --> 00:11:29.000
So, you see, Kazuya Saotome is our common enemy! But...

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:31.500
Since I treated you to ramen, I'm the boss here.

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:34.650
Look, I'll do anythin', as long as I get that payment today.

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:37.210
You have a hell of an accent.

00:11:37.210 --> 00:11:39.090
It comes out when I get exclted.

00:11:39.090 --> 00:11:42.130
I was born in the Hiroshima area. Don't mind it.

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:45.810
Oh, I see. Ah! The mini-bot!

00:11:49.470 --> 00:11:51.310
Cyber Doll May?

00:11:51.310 --> 00:11:53.350
I can't reclaim merchandise until I confirm that

00:11:53.350 --> 00:11:55.770
the one who ordered it hasn't sent the money to pay for it.

00:11:55.770 --> 00:11:58.280
That's what the manual says.

00:11:58.280 --> 00:12:00.490
Oh, then shouldn't we at least follow her?

00:12:00.490 --> 00:12:03.280
She'll lose us! We'll lose her! We'll lose our trail!

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:05.990
You'll be so-o-orry!

00:12:06.230 --> 00:12:08.660
<i>I'll find where she's going soon enough.</i>

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:33.960
Wait for me, Kazuya...

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:45.300
It's 100 meters from the apartment. I've got a long way to go.

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:48.370
Please let me go!

00:12:53.710 --> 00:12:56.170
Oh, it's so pretty!

00:12:57.010 --> 00:13:00.450
I wonder if I can go straight to Kazuya like this?

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:12.120
I wasn't built for this!

00:13:15.790 --> 00:13:18.590
My battery! What'll I do?!

00:13:23.170 --> 00:13:26.530
Mr. Cat, that wasn't nice, stopping short like that!

00:13:35.650 --> 00:13:39.080
Hold it right there, Tannhauser! Course record!

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:40.880
Let's get going!

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:42.210
Let's try that again...

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:44.130
Hold it right there, Saotome!

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:46.340
Hi, Nanbara. What's up?

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:51.560
Saotome, are you rich? No, of course not!

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:54.690
You'll be poor for the next ten thousand years!

00:13:57.570 --> 00:13:59.730
Mr. Kazuya Saotome, I presume?

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:02.860
I'm from the Cyberdyne Corp's customer service division.

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:04.190
My name is Sara!

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:06.650
Uh, sure. Sara, huh?

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:09.700
Yes, sir! Payment is due

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:13.550
on the Cyber Doll May unit you ordered.

00:14:13.550 --> 00:14:14.700
Could you please pay it today?

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:18.120
It's due today! You got the money, Saotome?!

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:21.820
Why don't we discuss this in my room instead of standing out here?

00:14:22.690 --> 00:14:27.150
It's... It's... It's a little messy, though.

00:14:28.170 --> 00:14:31.260
Looks like we'll have to stand in here, too, Saotome.

00:14:31.440 --> 00:14:34.220
Did May go outside by herself?

00:14:34.220 --> 00:14:38.270
Mr. Saotome, about the payment for Cyber Doll May...

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:41.590
That mini-bot went outside, you know.

00:14:42.180 --> 00:14:44.440
But where would she have gone, and for what?

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:47.360
Since you accepted delivery, you do owe us money now.

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:50.050
Do you think Saotome has any money?

00:14:50.660 --> 00:14:52.870
I thought I put it into sleep mode before.

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:54.790
Anyway, it's due today.

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:55.990
One, two!

00:14:55.990 --> 00:14:59.000
If May used it, I can just check the time stamp.

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:04.000
If you don't pay me, I'll have to reclaim the merchandise.

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:05.380
You understand, don't you?

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:07.840
Your mini-bot will never come back!

00:15:08.880 --> 00:15:10.720
Dammit, are you listenin' to me?!

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:12.470
You aren't, are you, Saotome?!

00:15:12.470 --> 00:15:13.710
Dammit, would ya pay attention?!

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:15.680
You aren't paying any attention, Saotome!

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:18.220
I see! She went to the university!

00:15:18.220 --> 00:15:18.230
Yer really pissin' me off, pal!
I see! She went to the university!

00:15:18.230 --> 00:15:19.980
Yer really pissin' me off, pal!

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:21.440
Yeah, she's pretty pissed now, Saotome!

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:21.770
All right!

00:15:22.350 --> 00:15:25.270
Excuse me, but I have to rush out for something important.

00:15:25.270 --> 00:15:27.780
We'll have to have our talk later, okay?

00:15:29.690 --> 00:15:31.390
Looks like I'll have to reclaim the merchandise.

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:33.660
You're sure relaxed about all this.

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:35.950
He doesn't know Cyber Doll May's location.

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:37.240
I, on the other hand...

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:45.620
Hey! You'll never see her from up here.

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:51.450
I'll find her! And when I do, I'll reclaim Cyber Doll May!

00:16:03.660 --> 00:16:05.310
Found her!

00:16:07.370 --> 00:16:09.230
Sara, wait for me!

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:11.280
Just run off and forget that I treated you to ramen, huh?!

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:13.240
You forgot that I'm the boss here!

00:16:41.140 --> 00:16:42.640
Oh...

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:44.520
Every time I recharge, this happens!

00:16:44.520 --> 00:16:46.690
I just want to get to Kazuya as fast as I can!

00:16:46.690 --> 00:16:49.510
Oh, I'm afraid you won't be doing that. Found you!

00:16:53.740 --> 00:16:55.700
I'm reclaiming you,

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:58.070
and if you want to blame anyone for it, blame your master—

00:16:59.530 --> 00:17:01.450
What's the big idea?!

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:03.660
Now be good and let me reclaim you!

00:17:07.930 --> 00:17:09.890
You can't escape me!

00:17:14.090 --> 00:17:15.340
<i>Kazuya...</i>

00:17:16.370 --> 00:17:17.970
According to the map,

00:17:17.970 --> 00:17:21.060
she should be around here someplace.

00:17:24.380 --> 00:17:26.810
I'll never find her in here!

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:30.310
I have to find her!

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:32.980
What's with that guy?

00:17:32.980 --> 00:17:34.570
A pervert! He's a pervert!

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:43.830
I said you can't escape!

00:17:45.630 --> 00:17:48.580
<i>I can't get caught. Not till I get this to Kazuya!</i>

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:04.470
Where is she? Where is she?

00:18:10.660 --> 00:18:12.980
Just how long are you going to keep this up?

00:18:13.190 --> 00:18:15.240
<i>I have to get this to Kazuya!</i>

00:18:15.890 --> 00:18:20.490
May? Where are you? May!

00:18:23.840 --> 00:18:25.170
"This Way to May." What the...?

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:30.880
I don't know why they're there, but...

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:49.770
Your battery's going to run out soon.

00:18:49.770 --> 00:18:52.770
It's time we ended this little game.

00:18:54.630 --> 00:18:56.190
May!

00:18:59.470 --> 00:19:01.030
<i>Kazuya!</i>

00:19:01.570 --> 00:19:03.130
Ma-a-a-y!

00:19:03.540 --> 00:19:06.410
<i>Kazuya!</i>

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:11.050
No, you don't!

00:19:11.050 --> 00:19:12.750
SARA!

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:14.590
There you are, Sara!

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:16.950
Prepare to be chastised! Pulverized! Exorcised!

00:19:17.790 --> 00:19:20.220
Come back here!

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:22.680
May, I was so worried about you.

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:23.800
Kazuya...

00:19:24.470 --> 00:19:27.220
Didn't I tell you not to go outside alone?

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:32.270
I was going to bring you this from Kasumi.

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:35.070
I wanted to be useful to you.

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:38.110
To bring it to you quickly...

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:41.540
Then, I would be...

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:45.180
I would be useful.

00:19:51.690 --> 00:19:52.920
May...

00:19:57.060 --> 00:19:58.250
Hold it, Sara!

00:19:58.250 --> 00:20:02.680
Kotaro Nanbara will not stand to be mocked, blocked, or stocked!

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:06.790
Chastise! Pulverize! Exorcise!

00:20:10.010 --> 00:20:14.600
Kasumi, I wrecked your bag. I'm so sorry!

00:20:14.880 --> 00:20:17.020
Oh, it's okay. Don't worry about it.

00:20:17.020 --> 00:20:19.320
If I'd just given them to you directly,

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:20.940
that whole mess could've been avoided.

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:22.280
May I try them on?

00:20:22.280 --> 00:20:24.610
Sure. Sorry if they're a little old.

00:20:24.890 --> 00:20:27.120
Still, Kasumi, these are incredible.

00:20:29.560 --> 00:20:30.730
Kasumi...

00:20:32.730 --> 00:20:35.530
How do they fit, May?

00:20:36.070 --> 00:20:38.340
Hang on, I'll tell you in a sec.

00:20:38.600 --> 00:20:40.740
What are you looking at?!

00:20:40.740 --> 00:20:42.720
Oh, I... S-S-Sorry!

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:43.840
Jeez...

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:45.300
He can be so dense.

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:51.850
Look, it's perfect!

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:55.150
Wow! Perfect! Perfect! Perfect!

00:20:55.150 --> 00:20:56.030
That's great, May.

00:20:56.030 --> 00:20:56.360
Yeah!

00:20:56.690 --> 00:21:00.610
May, from now on, never go outside alone.

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:02.240
Do you promise?

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:04.180
Yes, Kazuya!

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:08.270
<i>I got new clothes from Kasumi today!</i>

00:21:08.270 --> 00:21:10.240
<i>I'm so happy!</i>

00:21:10.470 --> 00:21:12.790
<i>Thanks so much, Kasumi!</i>

00:21:12.790 --> 00:21:17.130
<i>Still, I caused a lot of trouble for Kazuya today.</i>

00:21:17.130 --> 00:21:19.170
<i>I'm sorry about that!</i>

00:21:19.170 --> 00:21:23.670
<i>From now on, I'll keep my promises! You'll see, Kazuya!</i>

00:21:24.180 --> 00:21:27.550
<i>All right! I'll give this job my best again tomorrow!</i>

00:21:36.090 --> 00:21:45.160
When I'm with you, I blush till my ears turn red.

00:21:45.160 --> 00:21:49.370
I wonder why that is...

00:21:49.370 --> 00:21:55.610
When I'm alone with you, I can never seem to do anything right.

00:21:55.610 --> 00:22:02.780
I become so tongue-tied I can't speak at all.

00:22:03.520 --> 00:22:10.590
It's strange, don't you think? I think about it too much.

00:22:10.590 --> 00:22:19.700
Is this love? I just can't accept that at all.

00:22:20.100 --> 00:22:26.740
I can't be honest. I want so much to be.

00:22:26.740 --> 00:22:33.410
Someday, perhaps, you'll tell me

00:22:33.410 --> 00:22:41.020
the true feelings that are in my heart.

00:22:45.700 --> 00:22:46.420
Hey, Nara—

00:22:46.420 --> 00:22:47.670
That's where the Daibutsu is.

00:22:47.670 --> 00:22:48.470
Wara?

00:22:48.470 --> 00:22:49.720
I can be lost in it.

00:22:49.720 --> 00:22:50.260
Tara!

00:22:50.260 --> 00:22:51.090
Goo-goo.

00:22:51.090 --> 00:22:52.300
Okay, what's your name again?

00:22:52.300 --> 00:22:53.060
It's Sara.

00:22:53.060 --> 00:22:53.760
Oh, right. Sara...

00:22:53.760 --> 00:22:55.180
Was saying "goo-goo" really necessary?!

00:22:55.180 --> 00:22:55.680
Ara.

00:22:55.680 --> 00:22:58.230
"What Should I Do?"
